<!-- BLOG HEADER -->
<div class="blog-header">
  <div class="blog-header-inner">
    <div class="header-eyebrow">Me vs. Collector — The Blog</div>
    <h1>Plain-English guides<br>for people getting harassed.</h1>
    <p>FDCPA rights explained. Common violations broken down. Step-by-step strategies for fighting back — written for someone getting calls at midnight, not a law school classroom.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FILTER TABS -->
<div class="filter-bar">
  <button id="tab-all"        class="filter-tab active" onclick="filterPosts('all', this)">All Posts</button>
  <button id="tab-violation"  class="filter-tab" onclick="filterPosts('violation', this)">Violations</button>
  <button id="tab-strategy"   class="filter-tab" onclick="filterPosts('strategy', this)">Strategy</button>
  <button id="tab-lawsuit"    class="filter-tab" onclick="filterPosts('lawsuit', this)">Lawsuits</button>
  <button id="tab-debt-types" class="filter-tab" onclick="filterPosts('debt-types', this)">Debt Types</button>
  <button id="tab-state"      class="filter-tab" onclick="filterPosts('state', this)">State Laws</button>
  <button id="tab-news"       class="filter-tab" onclick="filterPosts('news', this)">News &amp; Context</button>
</div>

<!-- MAIN LAYOUT -->
<div class="blog-layout">
  <main>

    <!-- FEATURED -->
    <a href="blog/can-they-do-that.html" class="featured-post">
      <div class="featured-inner">
        <div class="featured-label">Latest Post</div>
        <div class="featured-title">"Can They Do That?" — 6 Things I Googled When a Debt Collector Came After Me</div>
        <p class="featured-desc">I had no idea what collectors were actually allowed to do. So I looked it up. Calling at work, contacting family, threatening arrest, how many calls is too many — here are the six questions I searched first and the answers I actually found.</p>
        <div class="featured-meta">
          <span class="meta-tag">Violations</span>
          <span>May 2026</span>
          <span>10 min read</span>
          <span class="read-link">Read now →</span>
        </div>
        <div class="featured-share-row">
          <span class="share-label-text">Share this post:</span>
          <div class="share-wrap">
            <button class="share-btn" onclick="toggleShare(event, this)" data-url="blog/can-they-do-that.html" data-title='"Can They Do That?" — 6 Things I Googled When a Debt Collector Came After Me'>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"/><line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"/></svg>
              Share
            </button>
            <div class="share-dropdown">
              <div class="share-dropdown-title">Share via</div>
              <button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event, 'twitter', this)">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-4.714-6.231-5.401 6.231H2.746l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.259 5.63zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
                X (Twitter)
              </button>
              <button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event, 'facebook', this)">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
                Facebook
              </button>
              <button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event, 'linkedin', this)">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
                LinkedIn
              </button>
              <button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event, 'copy', this)">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg>
                Copy Link
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
