      <a href="blog/cease-and-desist-letter.html" class="post-item" data-cat="strategy">
        <div class="post-item-num">05</div>
        <div class="post-item-body">
          <span class="post-item-tag">Strategy</span>
          <div class="post-item-title">I Sent a Cease and Desist Letter to a Debt Collector. The Calls Stopped.</div>
