        <div class="post-item-body">
          <span class="post-item-tag red">Violation</span>
          <div class="post-item-title">The Statute of Limitations on Debt: Why Collectors Pray You Don't Ask</div>
          <p class="post-item-desc">Every debt expires for legal purposes. Threatening to sue on time-barred debt is potentially illegal. Here's how to find out if your debt is past the limit — by state.</p>
          <span class="post-item-meta">Coming soon</span>
          <div class="post-share-row"><div class="share-wrap"><button class="share-btn" onclick="toggleShare(event,this)" data-url="#" data-title="The Statute of Limitations on Debt: Why Collectors Pray You Don't Ask"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"/><line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"/></svg>Share</button><div class="share-dropdown"><div class="share-dropdown-title">Share via</div><button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event,'twitter',this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-4.714-6.231-5.401 6.231H2.746l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.259 5.63zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>X (Twitter)</button><button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event,'facebook',this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>Facebook</button><button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event,'linkedin',this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>LinkedIn</button><button class="share-option" onclick="shareVia(event,'copy',this)"><svg viewBox="0 